:: Start {"position": "625,275", "size": "100,100"}
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h3>Welcome to Vascular Village!</h3><p>Meet Ruby, your guide on an amazing adventure inside the human body! 🔬</p><p>Follow Ruby as she explores the body's incredible systems, how they work together, and learns the little things we can do every day to stay healthy.</p><p>From the heart pumping blood to the lungs bringing in oxygen, every discovery brings Ruby one step closer to understanding how our bodies keep us going!</p><p><strong>Are you ready to join Ruby and explore the wonders of Vascular Village?</strong></p><div class="start-buttons"><div class="start-buttons"><<button "Let's Explore!">><<goto "ScenarioMenu">><</button>><<button "🎓 Tutorial">><<goto "TutorialRuby">><</button>></div></div>


/* MAIN HOME SCREEN  */
/* can find body in adobe stock for main screen */
:: HomeScreen
<div class="home-screen">
    <h1>Vascular Village</h1><p>Choose a part of your health journey!</p><div class="body-map">
        <div class="body-circle head">
            [[🧠Brain->Brain]]
        </div>
        <div class="body-circle left">
            [[🩸Blood Cells->Blood Cells]]
        </div>
        <div class="body-circle center">
            [[❤️Heartbeat->Heart]]
        </div>
        <div class="body-circle right">
            [[🩸Blood Vessels->Blood Vessels]]
        </div>
        <div class="body-circle legs">
            [[🫁Lungs->Lungs]]
        </div>
</div>

<p class="back-link "> <<button "Let's Explore! →">><<goto "ScenarioMenu">><</button>></p>
    <p class="home-hint">Tap a circle to begin exploring! Or take the tutorial to learn how activities work before you begin!</p><div class="tutorial-home-button"><<button "🎓 Take the Tutorial">><<goto "TutorialStart">><</button>></div>
</div>


