/* TUTORIAL */


:: TutorialRuby
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h2>Meet Ruby, Your Little Guide!</h2><p>I'm a red blood cell, and I'm part of your body's amazing circulatory system.</p><p>My job is to travel around your body, carrying oxygen to the places that need it. I travel through blood vessels, pass by the heart, and visit different parts of the body every day!</p><p>Together, we'll explore different body systems and discover how they work together to keep us healthy.</p><p><strong>Are you ready to explore the body with me?</strong></p><div class="tutorial-navigation"><<button "Let's Go! →">><<goto "TutorialScenario">><</button>></div>
</div>


:: TutorialScenario
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h2>Step 1: Choose a Scenario</h2><p>A scenario is a real situation that helps us understand how the human body works and how our everyday choices can affect our health.</p><p>Each scenario contains several activities. By completing these activities, you'll discover how different parts of the body work together in each scenario.</p><p><strong>Your mission is to explore the scenario and help me discover what is happening inside the body!</strong></p><div class="tutorial-navigation"><<button "Continue →">><<goto "TutorialBodyMap">><</button>></div>
</div>


:: TutorialBodyMap
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h2>Step 2: Explore Body Map</h2><p>Once you choose a scenario, you'll see a map of the human body.</p><p>Each circle represents a body system in your scenario and dims when its activity is complete.</p><ul><li>🧠 Brain</li><li>🩸 Blood Cells</li><li>❤️ Heart</li><li>🩸 Blood Vessels</li><li>🫁 Lungs</li></ul><p><strong>Explore each highlighted area to uncover everything happening inside the body!</strong></p><div class="tutorial-navigation"><<button "Continue →">><<goto "TutorialActivity">><</button>></div>
</div>


:: TutorialActivity
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h2>Step 3: Complete an Activity</h2><p>Select a body system to open an activity and discover what happens inside your body. Read the instructions carefully and choose the healthy actions or correct answers.</p><p>After each choice, Ruby will give you feedback explaining why your answer is correct and how it helps the body. Keep choosing the correct answers until you complete all the required choices for the activity!</p><p><strong>Remember, every correct choice brings you one step closer to completing your mission!</strong></p><div class="tutorial-navigation"><<button "Continue →">><<goto "TutorialLessons">><</button>></div>
</div>


:: TutorialLessons
<div class="tutorial-panel"><h2>Step 4: Discover What You've Learned!</h2><p>Every completed activity unlocks a special lesson that explains the important information you've discovered.</p><p>When every activity is completed, you unlock the scenario lesson, which brings everything together for a completed scenario.</p><p>Remember, you can return to unfinished scenarios anytime you'd like</p><p><strong>Every activity is a new discovery, and every completed scenario brings you closer to understanding the amazing human body!</strong></p><div class="tutorial-navigation"><<button "🏠 Start Exploring!">><<goto "ScenarioMenu">><</button>></div>
</div>


